    "causal_summary": "Wave 5 (final) of the over-engineering removal program: remove the CAS-mutator methods (prepareCutover, compareAndSwap, compareAndSwapRollback, compareAndSwapFinalize) from per-mode-authority-flip/authority-registry.ts once their only production callers (phase 004's enable-modes.cjs and flip-authority.cjs) are gone, keeping the load-bearing read path and the lock-reclaim machinery intact. High-adjacency to the fail-closed authorization gateway; runs last and only after phase 004 is green.",
